# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include exactly what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. Anything new (a pipeline directory, a dump, a secret, coverage output)
# stays out of the build context by construction rather than by remembering.
*

# Keep in sync with the Dockerfile's COPY lines, one for one.
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal

# Last match wins, so this comes after the re-includes. `go build` ignores test
# files; they would only enlarge the context and bust the cache.
**/*_test.go
